; rbl.test: a DNS blocklist. 127.0.0.2 is the conventional always-listed test entry.
$ORIGIN rbl.test.
$TTL 60
@                IN SOA  ns.rbl.test. hostmaster.rbl.test. 1 3600 600 86400 60
@                IN NS   ns.rbl.test.
ns               IN A    127.0.0.1
2.0.0.127        IN A    127.0.0.2
2.0.0.127        IN TXT  "Listed by rbl.test (integration fixture)"
